    "updated_at": "2024-10-16T15:19:03Z",
    "body": "I think this currently achieved with cookies. You want the server to be stateless, but the client needs to remember it's variant and stick to it. \r\nI guess that's exactly the problem you're trying to avoid. So IIUC, unless another solution is found, this is strictly out of scope, which is fine. ",
